{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_6cf8f0ff55f2401f8cc7c73975fc958e","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 4:2: 03 · Workspace"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75df56c1-a33f-42dc-b669-6033877ca56d","uuid":"dff8d342-76d3-4f3d-a5f0-f5cd8357af4e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:32:05.545Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 4:2: 03 · Workspace"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"2845a150-2b24-4fdc-8180-de6aad9addd2"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_6cf8f0ff55f2401f8cc7c73975fc958e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202611012032057035654358268d9d65OBk1pk8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_b1f8a2c176e74ec4ad6680a9a4649851","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const pages = figma.root.children;\n  let result = [];\n  for (const page of pages) {\n    await page.loadAsync();\n    let textNodes = page.findAll(n => n.type === 'TEXT');\n    let pageSummary = {\n      name: page.name,\n      id: page.id,\n      texts: textNodes.map(t => ({ id: t.id, name: t.name, characters: t.characters }))\n    };\n    result.push(pageSummary);\n  }\n  return result;\n})()","description":"Read text content from all pages to inspect design tasks, foundations, components, and media","fileKey":"Zwk7o6bydULuuGjjhDNpzE"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10785,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":8222},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75df56c1-a33f-42dc-b669-6033877ca56d","uuid":"294e73eb-b3d8-4be0-a91c-0f22e9d87b91","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:32:10.770Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_b1f8a2c176e74ec4ad6680a9a4649851","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_b1f8a2c176e74ec4ad6680a9a4649851","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"name\":\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\",\"id\":\"0:1\",\"texts\":[{\"id\":\"3:4\",\"name\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\"},{\"id\":\"3:5\",\"name\":\"MAC — digital marketing agency landing page\",\"characters\":\"MAC — digital marketing agency landing page\"},{\"id\":\"3:6\",\"name\":\"Design the landing page of a digital marketing agency: introduce the agency, prove results, show case studies, answer common questions and invite visitors to get in touch. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design the landing page of a digital marketing agency: introduce the agency, prove results, show case studies, answer common questions and invite visitors to get in touch. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\"},{\"id\":\"3:8\",\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\"},{\"id\":\"3:9\",\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 1 frame below, named exactly as listed. It is a single landing page, so there is no prototype to wire. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, the social logos and the icons from 04 · Media. The source has no photography: case-study thumbnails, the video poster and the avatars are image placeholders — keep them as placeholders. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 1 frame below, named exactly as listed. It is a single landing page, so there is no prototype to wire.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, the social logos and the icons from 04 · Media. The source has no photography: case-study thumbnails, the video poster and the avatars are image placeholders — keep them as placeholders.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\"},{\"id\":\"3:11\",\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"id\":\"3:12\",\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\"},{\"id\":\"3:15\",\"name\":\"01_Home\",\"characters\":\"01_Home\"},{\"id\":\"3:16\",\"name\":\"Goal: Understand what the agency does, trust it, and get in touch.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Understand what the agency does, trust it, and get in touch.\"},{\"id\":\"3:17\",\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"id\":\"3:18\",\"name\":\"• About: “Provide the best service with out-of-the-box ideas” · “We are a passionate team of digital marketing enthusiasts dedicated to helping businesses succeed in the digital world. With years of experience and a deep understanding of the ever-evolving online landscape, we stay at the forefront of industry trends and technologies.” • Blog: “Digital Marketing & SEO Services That Grow Traffic & Increase Revenue” · “We are the top digital marketing agency for branding corp. We offer a full range of services to help clients improve their search engine rankings and drive more traffic to their websites.” · “See more” · 3 article cards, each with “5 min read”, title, excerpt and open (Icon_Arrow_Right) (see DATA) • Call to action: “Ready to work with us?” · “Get Started” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Case studies: “Real-world examples of how we have helped companies achieve their marketing objectives.” · filters All Work [20] · UI/UX Design [10] · Digital Marketing [5] · Branding [5] · current filter: UI/UX Design · 3 case-study cards with image placeholders (see DATA) · the first card is shown in its hover state with “See Details” • FAQ: “Digital Marketing FAQs” · “As a leading digital marketing agency, we are dedicated to providing comprehensive educational resources and answering frequently asked questions to help our clients.” · “More Questions” · “Contact Us” · 4 questions (see DATA) · the first question is expanded with its answer, the other three are collapsed (Icon_Minus / Icon_Plus) • Footer: see DATA (Footer) • Header: Logo_MAC · navigation Service · Agency · Case Study · Resources (each with a dropdown, Icon_Chevron_Down) · Contact · “Get started” · notifications (Icon_Bell) • Hero stats: “230+” · “some big companies that we work with, and trust us very much” · progress bar (no value given) · growth badge (Icon_Trending_Up) · traffic card “Drive More Traffic and Sales” · “Drive more traffic and product sales” · 3-bar rising chart (no values given) • Hero: “Stay ahead of the curve with our forward-thinking” · “An award-winning SEO agency with disciplines in digital marketing, design, and website development, focused on understanding you.” · “Schedule Call” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · “View Case Study” • Projects & video: “920+” · “Projects finished superbly” · 4 avatar placeholders and “+” · video placeholder “HOW WE WORK” · play (Icon_Play) • Testimonial: “They thoroughly analyze our industry and target audience, allowing them to develop customized campaigns that effectively reach and engage our customers. Their creative ideas and cutting-edge techniques have helped us stay ahead of the competition.” · avatar placeholder · Michael Kaizer · CEO of Campfield Corp · pager “01/05” · previous / next (Icon_Arrow_Left, Icon_Arrow_Right) • Trusted by: “Trusted by the world’s biggest brands” · 3 client wordmarks set as text: Paywise · Campfield · Mazeline\",\"characters\":\"• About: “Provide the best service with out-of-the-box ideas” · “We are a passionate team of digital marketing enthusiasts dedicated to helping businesses succeed in the digital world. With years of experience and a deep understanding of the ever-evolving online landscape, we stay at the forefront of industry trends and technologies.”\\n• Blog: “Digital Marketing & SEO Services That Grow Traffic & Increase Revenue” · “We are the top digital marketing agency for branding corp. We offer a full range of services to help clients improve their search engine rankings and drive more traffic to their websites.” · “See more” · 3 article cards, each with “5 min read”, title, excerpt and open (Icon_Arrow_Right) (see DATA)\\n• Call to action: “Ready to work with us?” · “Get Started” (Icon_Arrow_Right)\\n• Case studies: “Real-world examples of how we have helped companies achieve their marketing objectives.” · filters All Work [20] · UI/UX Design [10] · 