panies that we work with, and trust us very much” · progress bar (no value given) · growth badge (Icon_Trending_Up) · traffic card “Drive More Traffic and Sales” · “Drive more traffic and product sales” · 3-bar rising chart (no values given)\\n• Hero: “Stay ahead of the curve with our forward-thinking” · “An award-winning SEO agency with disciplines in digital marketing, design, and website development, focused on understanding you.” · “Schedule Call” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · “View Case Study”\\n• Projects & video: “920+” · “Projects finished superbly” · 4 avatar placeholders and “+” · video placeholder “HOW WE WORK” · play (Icon_Play)\\n• Testimonial: “They thoroughly analyze our industry and target audience, allowing them to develop customized campaigns that effectively reach and engage our customers. Their creative ideas and cutting-edge techniques have helped us stay ahead of the competition.” · avatar placeholder · Michael Kaizer · CEO of Campfield Corp · pager “01/05” · previous / next (Icon_Arrow_Left, Icon_Arrow_Right)\\n• Trusted by: “Trusted by the world’s biggest brands” · 3 client wordmarks set as text: Paywise · Campfield · Mazeline\"},{\"id\":\"3:19\",\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"id\":\"3:20\",\"name\":\"Single-page task: no links between frames. Every button and link is entry only.\",\"characters\":\"Single-page task: no links between frames. Every button and link is entry only.\"},{\"id\":\"3:22\",\"name\":\"Navigation structure\",\"characters\":\"Navigation structure\"},{\"id\":\"3:23\",\"name\":\"• One frame. The header and footer are part of it. • Entry only (no frame): header menu items and their dropdowns, Get started, notifications, Schedule Call, View Case Study, play video, filters, See Details, case-study cards, testimonial pager, More Questions, Contact Us, FAQ questions (expand / collapse is a state on the same frame), See more, article cards, Get Started, footer links, social logos.\",\"characters\":\"• One frame. The header and footer are part of it.\\n• Entry only (no frame): header menu items and their dropdowns, Get started, notifications, Schedule Call, View Case Study, play video, filters, See Details, case-study cards, testimonial pager, More Questions, Contact Us, FAQ questions (expand / collapse is a state on the same frame), See more, article cards, Get Started, footer links, social logos.\"},{\"id\":\"3:25\",\"name\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"characters\":\"Fixed data & copy\"},{\"id\":\"3:26\",\"name\":\"Use these values verbatim.\",\"characters\":\"Use these values verbatim.\"},{\"id\":\"3:29\",\"name\":\"Case-study cards (in order)\",\"characters\":\"Case-study cards (in order)\"},{\"id\":\"3:30\",\"name\":\"1 · hover state: image placeholder with “See Details” (no caption shown) 2 · “Ai Corporation. 2023” — “Ai Wave - Ai Chatbot Mobile App” 3 · “Lancer Corporation. 2023” — “App Lancer - Freelance Mobile App”\",\"characters\":\"1 · hover state: image placeholder with “See Details” (no caption shown)\\n2 · “Ai Corporation. 2023” — “Ai Wave - Ai Chatbot Mobile App”\\n3 · “Lancer Corporation. 2023” — “App Lancer - Freelance Mobile App”\"},{\"id\":\"3:32\",\"name\":\"FAQ (in order)\",\"characters\":\"FAQ (in order)\"},{\"id\":\"3:33\",\"name\":\"Why is digital marketing important for my business? — expanded: “Digital marketing allows businesses to reach and engage with a wider audience, generate leads, drive website traffic, and increase brand visibility. It provides measurable results, allows for targeted marketing efforts, and enables businesses to adapt and optimize their strategies based on data and insights.” How can digital marketing help improve my website’s visibility? How long does it take to see results from digital marketing efforts? How do you measure the success of digital marketing campaigns?\",\"characters\":\"Why is digital marketing important for my business? — expanded: “Digital marketing allows businesses to reach and engage with a wider audience, generate leads, drive website traffic, and increase brand visibility. It provides measurable results, allows for targeted marketing efforts, and enables businesses to adapt and optimize their strategies based on data and insights.”\\nHow can digital marketing help improve my website’s visibility?\\nHow long does it take to see results from digital marketing efforts?\\nHow do you measure the success of digital marketing campaigns?\"},{\"id\":\"3:35\",\"name\":\"Articles (in order; all “5 min read”)\",\"characters\":\"Articles (in order; all “5 min read”)\"},{\"id\":\"3:36\",\"name\":\"How a Digital Marketing Agency Can Boost Your Business — “We are the top digital marketing agency for branding corp. We offer a full range of services to help clients improve their search engine rankings.” The Latest Trends and Strategies with a Digital Marketing Agency — “Working with this digital marketing agency has been a true partnership. They have taken the time to understand our business and industry.” Maximizing ROI with the Expertise of a Digital Marketing Agency — “What sets this digital marketing agency apart is their commitment to transparency and collaboration. They keep us informed every step of the way.”\",\"characters\":\"How a Digital Marketing Agency Can Boost Your Business — “We are the top digital marketing agency for branding corp. We offer a full range of services to help clients improve their search engine rankings.”\\nThe Latest Trends and Strategies with a Digital Marketing Agency — “Working with this digital marketing agency has been a true partnership. They have taken the time to understand our business and industry.”\\nMaximizing ROI with the Expertise of a Digital Marketing Agency — “What sets this digital marketing agency apart is their commitment to transparency and collaboration. They keep us informed every step of the way.”\"},{\"id\":\"3:38\",\"name\":\"Footer\",\"characters\":\"Footer\"},{\"id\":\"3:39\",\"name\":\"Logo_MAC · “We offer a comprehensive suite of digital marketing services that cover all aspects of your online presence. From SEO and social media marketing to content creation and PPC advertising, we have the expertise and resources to handle your diverse marketing needs.” Social: Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_LinkedIn · Logo_Instagram Navigation: Service · Agency · Case Study · Resources · Contact Licence: Privacy Policy · Copyright · Email Address Contact: (406) 555-0120 (Icon_Phone) · hey@example.com (Icon_Mail) · 2972 Westheimer Rd. Santa Ana, Illinois 85486 (Icon_Map_Pin)\",\"characters\":\"Logo_MAC · “We offer a comprehensive suite of digital marketing services that cover all aspects of your online presence. From SEO and social media marketing to content creation and PPC advertising, we have the expertise and resources to handle your diverse marketing needs.”\\nSocial: Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_LinkedIn · Logo_Instagram\\nNavigation: Service · Agency · Case Study · Resources · Contact\\nLicence: Privacy Policy · Copyright · Email Address\\nContact: (406) 555-0120 (Icon_Phone) · hey@example.com (Icon_Mail) · 2972 Westheimer Rd. Santa Ana, Illinois 85486 (Icon_Map_Pin)\"},{\"id\":\"3:41\",\"name\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\",\"characters\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\"},{\"id\":\"3:44\",\"name\":\"Fixed (given)\",\"characters\":\"Fixed (given)\"},{\"id\":\"3:45\",\"name\":\"• Frame name • Must-include content (what, not how) • All data and copy • Brand colors #99EA48 and #010205, and Plus Jakarta Sans • Media: logo, social logos, icons • Default Button\",\"characters\":\"• Frame name\\n• Must-include content (what, not how)\\n• All data and copy\\n• Brand colors #99EA48 and #010205, and Plus Jakarta Sans\\n• Media: logo, social logos, icons\\n• Default Button\"},{\"id\":\"3:47\",\"name\":\"Yours (designer decides)\",\"characters\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"id\":\"3:48\",\"name\":\"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis of every section • All other colors: neutrals, text, light / dark section backgrounds, surfaces, borders, chart and progress colors, selected filter, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current filter, card hover, expanded / collapsed FAQ, hover • Header with dropdown triggers, stat and chart cards, client wordmark row, video block, filter tags, case-study card, testimonial with pager, FAQ accordion, article card, CTA banner, footer • How image placeholders are sized and placed\",\"characters\":\"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis of every section\\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, light / dark section backgrounds, surfaces, borders, chart and progress colors, selected filter, error / disabled\\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\\n• All states: current filter, card hover, expanded / collapsed FAQ, hover\\n• Header with dropdown triggers, stat and chart cards, client wordmark row, video block, filter tags, case-study card, testimonial with pager, FAQ accordion, article card, CTA banner, footer\\n• How image placeholders are sized and placed\"},{\"id\":\"3:50\",\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"characters\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"id\":\"3:51\",\"name\":\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\",\"characters\":\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\"},{\"id\":\"3:52\",\"name\":\"1. Checklist coverage 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Information hierarchy across sections 4. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 5. Component reuse 6. State design (current filter, card hover, expanded FAQ)\",\"characters\":\"1. Checklist coverage\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Information hierarchy across sections\\n4. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n5. Component reuse\\n6. State design (current filter, card hover, expanded FAQ)\"},{\"id\":\"3:53\",\"name\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 1 named frame, your components.\",\"characters\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 1 named frame, your components.\"}]},{\"name\":\"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\",\"id\":\"1:2\",\"texts\":[{\"id\":\"1:6\",\"name\":\"Foundations · MAC\",\"characters\":\"Foundations · MAC\"},{\"id\":\"1:7\",\"name\":\"Fixed: the two brand colors and the typeface below (the MAC logo is in 04 · Media). Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, page and section backgrounds (light or dark), surfaces and borders, filter-tag and selected states, chart colors, error / disabled, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid.\",\"characters\":\"Fixed: the two brand colors and the typeface below (the MAC logo is in 04 · Media). Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, page and section backgrounds (light or dark), surfaces and borders, filter-tag and selected states, chart colors, error / disabled, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid.\"},{\"id\":\"1:8\",\"name\":\"Brand colors\",\"characters\":\"Brand colors\"},{\"id\":\"1:12\",\"name\":\"Brand primary · lime\",\"characters\":\"Brand primary · lime\"},{\"id\":\"1:13\",\"name\":\"#99EA48\",\"characters\":\"#99EA48\"},{\"id\":\"1:14\",\"name\":\"The agency’s signature accent. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"characters\":\"The agency’s signature accent. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\"},{\"id\":\"1:17\",\"name\":\"Brand ink\",\"characters\":\"Brand ink\"},{\"id\":\"1:18\",\"name\":\"#010205\",\"characters\":\"#010205\"},{\"id\":\"1:19\",\"name\":\"The near-black the brand pairs with its lime. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"characters\":\"The near-black the brand pairs with its lime. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\"},{\"id\":\"1:20\",\"name\":\"Typeface\",\"characters\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"1:21\",\"name\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 230+\",\"characters\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  230+\"},{\"id\":\"1:22\",\"name\":\"Use Plus Jakarta Sans for all UI text. Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\",\"characters\":\"Use Plus Jakarta Sans for all UI text. Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\"},{\"id\":\"1:23\",\"name\":\"Canvas: desktop web, 1440 wide. Light mode. Frame height is free — the landing page scrolls vertically.\",\"characters\":\"Canvas: desktop web, 1440 wide. Light mode. Frame height is free — the landing page scrolls vertically.\"}]},{\"name\":\"02 · Components 组件库\",\"id\":\"1:3\",\"texts\":[{\"id\":\"1:25\",\"name\":\"Components · MAC (default states only)\",\"characters\":\"Components · MAC (default states only)\"},{\"id\":\"1:26\",\"name\":\"Only a default Button is given (the page has no text input). Every state (hover, selected filter, expanded / collapsed FAQ item, current slide…), the header with its dropdown menus, the footer and every business component (stat card, chart card, client logo row, video block, filter tags, case-study card, testimonial with pager, FAQ accordion, blog card, CTA banner…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\",\"characters\":\"Only a default Button is given (the page has no text input). Every state (hover, selected filter, expanded / collapsed FAQ item, current slide…), the header with its dropdown menus, the footer and every business component (stat card, chart card, client logo row, video block, filter tags, case-study card, testimonial with pager, FAQ accordion, blog card, CTA banner…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\"},{\"id\":\"1:27\",\"name\":\"Button · default\",\"characters\":\"Button · default\"},{\"id\":\"1:29\",\"name\":\"Button\",\"characters\":\"Button\"}]},{\"name\":\"04 · Media 素材库\",\"id\":\"1:4\",\"texts\":[{\"id\":\"2:19\",\"name\":\"Media · MAC\",\"characters\":\"Media · MAC\"},{\"id\":\"2:20\",\"name\":\"Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Logo_MAC is the agency logo; Logo_ social marks are third-party marks (keep them unaltered). The source has no photography: case-study thumbnails, the video poster and avatars are image placeholders — treat them as such. Client logos are set as text (see brief). Icons are neutral (#1A1A1F) — recolor them to fit your color system.\",\"characters\":\"Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Logo_MAC is the agency logo; Logo_ social marks are third-party marks (keep them unaltered). The source has no photography: case-study thumbnails, the video poster and avatars are image placeholders — treat them as such. Client logos are set as text (see brief). Icons are neutral (#1A1A1F) — recolor them to fit your color system.\"},{\"id\":\"2:21\",\"name\":\"Logo\",\"characters\":\"Logo\"},{\"id\":\"2:24\",\"name\":\"Logo_MAC\",\"characters\":\"Logo_MAC\"},{\"id\":\"2:25\",\"name\":\"Social logos\",\"characters\":\"Social logos\"},{\"id\":\"2:28\",\"name\":\"Logo_Facebook\",\"characters\":\"Logo_Facebook\"},{\"id\":\"2:30\",\"name\":\"Logo_Instagram\",\"characters\":\"Logo_Instagram\"},{\"id\":\"2:32\",\"name\":\"Logo_LinkedIn\",\"characters\":\"Logo_LinkedIn\"},{\"id\":\"2:34\",\"name\":\"Logo_Twitter\",\"characters\":\"Logo_Twitter\"},{\"id\":\"2:35\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"characters\":\"Icons\"},{\"id\":\"2:38\",\"name\":\"Icon_Arrow_Left\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Arrow_Left\"},{\"id\":\"2:40\",\"name\":\"Icon_Arrow_Right\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Arrow_Right\"},{\"id\":\"2:42\",\"name\":\"Icon_Bell\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Bell\"},{\"id\":\"2:44\",\"name\":\"Icon_Chevron_Down\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Chevron_Down\"},{\"id\":\"2:46\",\"name\":\"Icon_Mail\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Mail\"},{\"id\":\"2:48\",\"name\":\"Icon_Map_Pin\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Map_Pin\"},{\"id\":\"2:50\",\"name\":\"Icon_Minus\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Minus\"},{\"id\":\"2:52\",\"name\":\"Icon_Phone\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Phone\"},{\"id\":\"2:54\",\"name\":\"Icon_Play\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Play\"},{\"id\":\"2:56\",\"name\":\"Icon_Plus\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Plus\"},{\"id\":\"2:58\",\"name\":\"Icon_Trending_Up\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Trending_Up\"}]},{\"name\":\"03 · Workspace\",\"id\":\"4:2\",\"texts\":[]}]"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"cd8db4ff-aaa5-4f1d-8bed-ea421f574609"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_b1f8a2c176e74ec4ad6680a9a4649851","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202611012032141410782828268d9d6nxct0UXx","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_707c7303ad144ec791a5b6951a34c5e0","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const mediaPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes('04 · Media'));\n  const compPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes('02 · Components'));\n  \n  await mediaPage.loadAsync();\n  await compPage.loadAsync();\n\n  const getNodes = (page) => {\n    return page.findAll(n => n.type === 'COMPONENT' || n.type === 'COMPONENT_SET' || n.type === 'FRAME' || n.type === 'GROUP').map(n => ({\n      id: n.id,\n      name: n.name,\n      type: n.type,\n      width: n.width,\n      height: n.height\n    }));\n  };\n\n  return {\n    media: getNodes(mediaPage),\n    components: getNodes(compPage)\n  };\n})()","description":"Get details of media and component nodes","fileKey":"Zwk7o6bydULuuGjjhDNpzE"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":16920,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":10804},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75df56c1-a33f-42dc-b669-6033877ca56d","uuid":"12c993e6-3e37-49f1-931e-fd74407d2b7f","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:32:19.020Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_707c7303ad144ec791a5b6951a34c5e0","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
